## Tabs

[tabs]
  [tab label=Overview]
    Tab labels render in a row; the active panel shows below. Click a label to switch — the document carries no script.
  [/tab]

  [tab label=Details]
    Tabs are declarative. The renderer emits the HTML and CSS that make them work.
  [/tab]

  [tab label=Notes]
    - Each tab is a `[tab label=...]` block
    - `[tabs]` may only contain `[tab]` children
    - The first tab starts active
  [/tab]
[/tabs]

