## Code blocks

```ts | greet.ts
export function greet(name: string): string {
  return `Hello, ${name}!`;
}
```

```
plain fenced block — no language token
keeps  its  spacing  verbatim
```

A fenced block also nests inside a component, and the code text keeps its own indentation:

[callout type=success]
  ```py
  def total(items):
      return sum(i.price for i in items)
  ```
[/callout]

